The fork keeps rpiv-todo's `todo` tool, `/todos` command, and overlay, and adds
the bookkeeping contract described in CONTRACT.md: the `todo/v1` snapshot
entry, the `todo:changed` event, metadata namespace validators, and the
`points`, `anchor`, and `evidence` task fields. Configuration helpers formerly
imported from @juicesharp/rpiv-config 2.15.0 (MIT, same copyright holder) are
vendored in src/config.ts.
